The Orb of Fate is a fun toy.  It's rarely something that I wish for
however, because my early wishes tend to get used for more pressing
matters such as magic resistance, reflection/bag of holding, or
teleport control (often in that order).  And by the later game, say by
the time I get the castle wand, I don't need anything the Orb has to
offer, nor do I have spare encumbrance, I've typically found too many
artifacts by then, and I'm better served by using the wish on a magic
marker for magic mapping and levelporting by scroll in Gehennom.

